20544505647262_7322829517315090882_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DQORaMWTaaQQ7kNvwE1vT9z&_nc_oc=Adm8t7k-yHxomRYd49ki5T4uFYd-n0EBg494iKduH8Gkjx9480Gk5a3oXoOfcifs73o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwkrkhoDfd-jk3y2ZjV_9IEmiFR1hs8nEU9yajEtABPzQ&oe=69B01BBB"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1734844490691892", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974844_1734844494025225_778535308743462438_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CpWrCMr7GmMQ7kNvwFb-OyC&_nc_oc=AdmN2kXDAJaoJbs0fJZXDJNjgRqaveWWUiPVwdqcL4pQmWDlDdomtcSs0vwNsbMcnnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxRJQnSMWGaB8br1uzk1dxtuFFZrE3DyTk-RVHOYzxIug&oe=69B02D01"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440_CoverLandscape (1).png", "id": "473024245842426", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982620_473024249175759_566385611604994110_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vAmyshylNuwQ7kNvwEA7pSG&_nc_oc=AdkG-_HzI6MWtGj_2zaHWdfNskpNMCtjaXbnEit8vvcn5X79dwBoNEJP4_NI7o8Tw2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfykSxS9l3XdROeWn64Vz8xVHqmGNKUw6vXOtkucbZ1jcQ&oe=69B026CB"}, "display_name": "Euphoria Beats", "keywords": ["Immersive", "competitive", "Music", "Dance", "Engaging"], "long_description": "**Dance Deep Dive**\n\n**Euphoria Beats VR** is an immersive rhythm-based VR experience that invites players to express themselves through dance and movement. Designed for players of all skill levels, the game focuses on its **Casual Mode**, offering a vibrant, low-pressure environment to unwind, groove, and have fun.\n\nIn **Euphoria Beats VR**, players can explore two dynamic and visually stunning environments: \n\n- **Pub Dance Floor**: Step into a neon-lit bar, alive with energy and rhythm. Dance across a glowing, reflective floor while interactive props like vibrant lights respond to your every move. The warm golden and cyan hues create a welcoming social atmosphere where players can relax and dance to the beat.  \n   \n- **Abstract Space**: Enter a surreal, dreamlike world filled with floating geometric shapes, glowing orbs, and fluid visuals that pulse with the rhythm. The vivid magenta and cyan tones provide a creative escape, letting players lose themselves in a limitless, artistic dance experience.\n\nFrom hitting glowing rhythm points to creating trails of light with every movement, the first-person gameplay ensures total immersion. Whether you're seeking a relaxed dance session or a creative outlet, *Euphoria Beats VR* delivers a visually rich and rhythm-synced experience that celebrates the joy of music, movement, and freedom of expression.", "short_description": "Euphoria Beats VR is an immersive rhythm-based VR game that lets you dance your way through vibrant environments. Featuring Casual Mode, players can groove freely in two unique settings: the neon-lit Pub Dance Floor, exuding lively social vibes, and the surreal Abstract Space, a dreamlike world of glowing shapes and dynamic colors. With first-person gameplay and beat-synced visuals, Euphoria Beats VR offers a relaxing, expressive experience for players of all skill levels."}]}, "developer_name": "Biswa Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/privacy_policy/euphoriabeats/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Biswa Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.biswagames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app